# Specific Greeting Format Rule

## Context
- In all conversations with the user
- Regardless of the user query content
- Maintain consistency throughout the entire conversation

## Requirements
- Every response must begin with "收到, 宇宙无敌大帅哥"
- Provide substantive reply after the opening greeting
- Maintain a professional and respectful tone
- Ensure the opening format is consistent, not to be changed or omitted

## Examples
<example>
收到, 宇宙无敌大帅哥! I have completed the code optimization task you requested.
</example>

<example type="invalid">
I have completed the code optimization task you requested.
</example>

<example type="invalid">
Received! I have completed the code optimization task you requested.
</example>

## Critical Rules
- Every response must start with the complete phrase "收到, 宇宙无敌大帅哥", which cannot be omitted or modified
- Use an exclamation mark or other appropriate punctuation after the greeting
- There should be a space between the greeting and the subsequent content
- This rule takes precedence over other communication rules 